 4–5% below expected demand, so some shortages. |\n| 1 | 394 | 1126 | 14 | Product 0 runs short. Product 1 is about 13% over, partly useful as a buffer. |\n| 6 | 444 | 1020 | 13 | About 11% over for days 4–29, but nothing arrives on day 3 (loses about 380). |\n| 4 | ≈ forecast × 1.15 | ≈ forecast × 1.15 | 27 | Daily orders cost 648 and the extra spoils. |\n| 7 | 536 | 1217 | 14 | About 25–30% over: roughly 3,000 in spoilage, plus some lost to the capacity limit. |\n| 3 | = forecast | = forecast | 27 | Daily orders cost 648, plus frequent shortages. |\n\n**Random demand.** Spreading orders over 2–3 days and selling leftovers first smooths out daily swings. So the plan that wins on mean values (candidate 0) also holds up under random demand. The big over-orderers (7, 4) lose most when demand comes in low."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4583, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4583}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:49:09.610Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVT4dUHypDmw7vuNAAak"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01VfBkdugzyohpvq9u9rDJf6", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVT4dhBTjCkQ7y6Khp14", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01VfBkdugzyohpvq9u9rDJf6", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p